# Applies to evaluator.Dockerfile only (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# from beside the Dockerfile), with the monorepo root as the build context.
#
# An ALLOWLIST: everything is excluded, then only what the build needs is let
# back in. A denylist fails open — a new .env, a credentials file or a 100 MB
# dist/ appears in the context the day someone forgets to list it. Here,
# forgetting fails the build instead.

*

!package.json
!bun.lock
!apps/servers
!apps/web/package.json
!packages

# Never in the image, wherever they appear inside what was let back in.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__tests__
**/coverage
apps/servers/scripts
